  \begin{enumerate}
  \item $F$ is a left adjoint\index{adjoint!functor}.\label{item:ct:ar1}
  \item For each $b:B$, the functor $(a \mapsto \hom_B(Fa,b))$ from $A\op$ to \uset is representable\index{representable functor}.\label{item:ct:ar2}
